  { question: "Is weed legal in Maine?", answer: "Yes. Recreational (adult-use) cannabis is legal in Maine for adults 21 and older. Maine voters legalized it in 2016, and licensed retail sales began in October 2020. You can legally buy, possess, and consume cannabis within the limits set by Title 28-B of the Maine Revised Statutes, regulated by the Maine Office of Cannabis Policy (OCP)." },
